LanguageData.VGE_LocationDestabilizingDesc:
An orbital location you're currently on is destabilizing. Soon it will collapse completely, and anything on it, including your colonists, will be gone.

Time remaining: {0}

Ensure you evacuate before the location burns up in atmosphere.

LanguageData.VGE_TributeDemandHover:
A salvager station is demanding tribute of {0} silver or it will open fire.

Time until tribute needs to be paid: {1}

You can ask them to postpone the payment, but the grav engine will be locked remotely until the tribute is paid or the station is defeated. You can also pay the fee immediately, if you have the funds. Running away will likely have the salvagers send a search party after you.

LanguageData.VGE_IncomingEnemyGravshipDesc:
An enemy gravship is approaching fast.

Time until arrival: {0}

You will not be able to escape before it arrives. Prepare for them to fire a volley at you and escape as soon as you can.
